    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第33篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">经常做AI短剧、动画、创意视频的读者老师们，应该都踩过同一个大坑：</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">想让AI只学动作，结果画风、人物、场景全被照搬。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">遇到简单抬手、走动这类基础动态，靠文字提示词还能勉强描述。一旦碰到舞蹈、武打、连贯走位、镜头环绕运镜这类复杂动态，文字描述根本精准不落地。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近LibTV 全新上线的深度动作捕捉，就是为了解决高精度可控这个行业通病。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">今天我直接拿高难度经典动作，章子怡在《十面埋伏》里的经典水袖击鼓舞，带大家完整走一遍真实创作流程，看看这次的升级到底有多实用。咱们先一起看看效果～</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4675557305613172739\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4675557305613172739\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCmrQzE4EVv9yMoC8miaM5d7vfTY9PGapnsiarrobRVzfA3sDdibyJofEvPRicl9Isib82Uu7Am94QhibS9EfcjxtYKRxqDxX6iamaHMvs%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-w=\"1080\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">各位读者老师，还原度如何？只复刻动作，场景、人物、服装都可以自定义，感觉是不是太爽了。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">除了深度动作捕捉之外，智能剪辑-口播创作也是近期一大功能亮点。一个搞定高精度可控动态，一个搞定短视频量产剪辑，刚好覆盖创意生视频、自媒体量产两大核心场景。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">接下来是详细教程，或许比大多数付费教程还要干货，有需要的读者老师，记得三连支持一下～</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003490\" data-ratio=\"0.15092592592592594\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClUlQS3XS3pmPMSSRJKaczIUN1EuNtfAgbNfuEROUwKsRkBZl5gy2vBAlBUJJHcTWZibx4wt8gruGN2U2qlDcaREelEzErDQicw0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">高难度武打动作复刻（深度动作捕捉）</span></b></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了测试功能上限，我特意选了《十面埋伏》经典水袖击鼓片段。这套动作难度极高，长袖翻飞、快速转身、定点击鼓、连贯走位，搭配镜头推拉跟拍，动态层次非常丰富。我们直接上传原视频到画布，点击视频，上方会弹出逐帧拉片，选择【深度动作捕捉】。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmPUOpmeXu28ylXfHnRMicQziaTtsJM180PG7nPm09fODDZTAXF0pTnwho1ibX1lBL7oBeppCRVxr3ZnGiamLYhdSOzLRNRrBRicbPU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5882899628252788\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1076\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003521\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这里建议大家优先选择720P分辨率，动态细节更精准，整体处理时长仅三四十秒，关键是全程不消耗Token，可以反复调试。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmSWDkFM3TUCux1DqvqicsnVDbL7iaHVBupdPQjRu8rXh2qS35z5Q6Y1dBLTHicqEf9v2vpuU3MbFuzDb2m1HpnoY5fE9ttCrndic4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5009416195856874\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"531\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003511\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">生成完成后，画布会产出一段黑白深度动态视频。很多人以为这只是普通的轮廓视频，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">其实彻底剥离了原视频的人物样貌、服装色彩、场景画风、画面滤镜，只精准保留人物肢体动态、走位轨迹、空间透视、镜头运镜四大核心信息。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">简单说就是，只学动作和运镜，不学画面和画风。</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4675558283238129664\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4675558283238129664\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCnLDPZAoUgOnoLOPEd8KCMZ5u0oPpIjv87woReYGWjBm2ia4p3aiaykpZiahStv90n92x3Sg5kTvIO1KSMFPiaxXhBaWztpZAiaKtCg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-w=\"1080\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">后续我叠加了全新的国风风格参考图，自定义提示词更换角色人设、场景氛围，重新生成成片。最终效果完全超出预期，水袖翻飞的弧度、击鼓的节奏、转身走位、镜头推拉的轨迹，几乎完美复刻原版高难度动态。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003518\" data-ratio=\"0.45868465430016864\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClQct3ibxDTaibia0cFib5zczfxRLFiaOfoicPBxbQ0pOPplBOepobpMQickdibzVFczDWlcibSZFVLBM6e5m0yxffb3csIicicCarYs7qMB4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1186\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">制作细节也会给到我们，可以提前有个判断。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCm5cZBSBK0KxuO1X9AmCicEI2H6eVlP0hiaibt5v62qf3ibYh3HafSn2pytk1WAT47OWvaZ8qicwUnL65R8sW8g9D6iaU60AzHgpMIibI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6773743016759777\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"716\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003514\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">点击生成出来的深度动作捕捉视频，进入对话框，输入要表达的画面。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCm7XkMtcGN7RTQBqP89icZvp94XzoFTvR3KrYcb5X0sYQyhicQqAmySPebYM61NYkiauPicMib4Q8Lbm76qtZW430pIzIgGKeLp6HKM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4519650655021834\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"458\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003512\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">换了人物色彩风格，动作依然很稳。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4675558449282498560\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4675558449282498560\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCkfAvSdmScecWJWsgnX6iaibyiaOuRC8N9WACIn0XGZRqgwuVunwLMFAib1EEGjKsCSfMzOBQmyBIVqicMzG2lVjWDolaBcFlypjXia0%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-w=\"1080\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">深度动作捕捉功能测试下来，可以看出全新AI角色画风统一、场景全新搭建，完全没有被原参考视频带偏。基本可以实现</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">一套万能动态，适配百种画风、百类角色的创作自由。</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003513\" data-ratio=\"0.14957264957264957\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkw4pHgqUPq91DiawPibCCiaop9SzoyNSVufGH5W3mo9GZSiaSNa8ZmeHrMX0S4vVD0fnBAL7ia5VNeh87G8VpOr4fmUZVHcuFZQpl8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1404\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">自媒体量产神器（智能剪辑-口播创作）</span></b></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我除了写公众号，平时也做一些口播视频。做口播视频最难都不是拍摄，剪辑才是最费时间的。一条几分钟的口播素材，人工粗剪就要1-2小时，还要手动配字幕、加BGM、插画面、做动态包装，一天都不一定搞得定。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次LibTV智能剪辑，直接把整套口播剪辑工作流全自动打通，从粗剪到精剪包装一步到位。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">直接给各位读者老师看看智能剪辑前后对比。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4675558605310230529\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4675558605310230529\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCmI0lwcSNdzL5vZicWicTldXRmaTGdDvkwIjlzr0JiaNA5OlVSPWetJ6jcLPMArvW5SiaM3mX8LbTug3YfHicdwy8y4Vyzu30Svck4g%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=